r, " [:a {:href "/athletes/46200"} "Claudia Poll"] ", would win this event for the first gold medal ever for Costa Rica. The bronze medal went to Friedrich’s teammate, " [:a {:href "/athletes/47749"} "Manuela Stellmach"] ". The Americans fell back on the final laps, with Wayte placing fourth and Kremer sixth."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "B Final"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "171"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47468"} "Heike Friedrich"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "1:59.02 (1 h6)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "1:57.65 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "93"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/46201"} "Sylvia Poll"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/CRC"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/CRC.png"}] "CRC"]] [:td {} "1:59.22 (1 h5)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "1:58.67 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "181"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/47749"} "Manuela Stellmach"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "2:00.30 (2 h5)"] [:td {} "–"] [:td {} "1:59.01 (3)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Bronze"} "Bronze"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "4"] [:td {:class "bib"} "340"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/51232"} "Mary Wayte"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/USA"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2